 the new Angular.dev documentation. This makes it challenging for users to understand how to work with anything that is returned. \r\n\r\n_Example_\r\nIn the Renderer2 class, there is important context in the comments in the codebase for what is returned from the `listen` method:\r\n![image](https://github.com/angular/angular/assets/13357861/910df0d3-0637-40e5-b812-f86a7c5b5b1f)\r\n\r\nHowever, this information (\"An unlisten function...\", this is a screenshot from your `main` branch) doesn't make it into the documentation on Angular.dev: https://angular.dev/api/core/Renderer2\r\n![image](https://github.com/angular/angular/assets/13357861/1b7d3bed-a455-44b4-966a-6f08d47fb9bf)\r\n\r\nI confirmed that this is occurring for classes outside of Renderer2 -- also a problem for HttpHeaders.\r\n\r\n### Enter the URL of the topic with the problem\r\n\r\nhttps://angular.dev/api/core/Renderer2\r\nhttps://angular.dev/api/common/http/HttpHeaders\r\n\r\n### Describe what you were looking for in the documentation\r\n\r\nInformation about what is returned from Angular methods that return something to the user.\r\n\r\n### Describe the actions that led you to experience the problem\r\n\r\nI needed to confirm what is returned by `Renderer2.listen` and could not without consulting the source code.\r\n\r\n### Describe what you want to experience that would fix the problem\r\n\r\nThe documentation renders comments from JSDoc `@returns` tags.\r\n\r\n### Add a screenshot if that helps illustrate the problem\r\n\r\nSee above.\r\n\r\n### If this problem caused an exception or error, please paste it here\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### If the problem is browser-specific, please specify the device, OS, browser, and version\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Provide any additional information here in as much as detail as you can\r\n\r\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"JeanMeche","id":1300985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDA5ODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300985?v=4","g